{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-598687487887410108 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRE_SALE_PAGE&editorId=598687178498769463&sectionId=598687487887410108)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_V6HCsyhQ_text","label":"gg_V6HCsyhQ_text","default":"The Discovery That Changed Everything"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEBYaMSTRb_text","label":"ggEBYaMSTRb_text","default":"<p>Deep in the Himalayas, at altitudes where nothing grows and the air itself feels thin, something has been forming for centuries.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The locals have a name for it. And for thousands of years, they kept it to themselves.</p><p>It seeps from ancient rock faces—a dense, dark resin, almost like blackstrap molasses, loaded with 85+ trace minerals and a compound called fulvic acid that modern science is only beginning to understand.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For thousands of years, men in these regions have consumed it. Not as a supplement. As a way of life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And they don't experience the same decline Western men do after 35.</p><p>This substance is called Shilajit. And it does something no synthetic pill, powder, or injection can replicate:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It gives your cells the raw materials to produce testosterone naturally—the way they did when you were 25.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not by forcing your body to do something unnatural.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By giving it what it's been missing.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9gwAXmssA_label","label":"gg9gwAXmssA_label","default":"<p>SEE IF WELLNESS NEST IS RIGHT FOR YOU</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY1EChf-yf_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggY1EChf-yf_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/1765349404-f684a1c4-b8ea-4da2-bda7-3850138e5bc7.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrjXEKysj6_text","label":"ggrjXEKysj6_text","default":"<p>“It felt like someone turned the lights back on.” – Men in real-world use report smoother energy, better stamina, and clearer focus.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYYOXGi2zT_text","label":"ggYYOXGi2zT_text","default":"<p>But here's the problem most men run into:</p><p><br>They try shilajit. They feel nothing. They assume it doesn't work.</p><p><br>It's not the shilajit that failed them. It's the product.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpKNPQtfAi_text","label":"ggpKNPQtfAi_text","default":"Why Most Shilajit Products Are Garbage"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiMw7ygwT7_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggiMw7ygwT7_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/1765349402-624443ae-2942-4d5a-a540-7128a88bbf7d.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7RD9yUH8v_text","label":"gg7RD9yUH8v_text","default":"<p>Now, before you go searching Amazon for \"shilajit,\" you need to know something.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most shilajit products on the market are worthless. Some are actually harmful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's why:</p><p><br><strong>Problem #1: They're not real shilajit. </strong>Most are synthetic imitations or heavily diluted blends that contain barely a trace of the real thing.</p><p><br><strong>Problem #2: They're overheated</strong>. Authentic shilajit is delicate. Industrial processing destroys the fulvic acid—the compound that actually does the work.</p><p><br><strong>Problem #3: They're contaminated. </strong>Cheap shilajit sourced from unknown regions often contains heavy metals, pesticides, and other toxins. You'd be putting poison in your body.</p><p><br><strong>Problem #4: They're underdosed.</strong> Even \"real\" shilajit products often contain such tiny amounts that you'd never feel anything.</p><p><br>This is why most men try shilajit once, feel nothing, and assume it doesn't work.</p><p><br><strong>Wellness Nest does things differently.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZ6sdvpxQ2_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggZ6sdvpxQ2_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/1760614603-18.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN7Yjwtw7W_text","label":"ggN7Yjwtw7W_text","default":"<p><i>Based on a 90-day clinical study of purified shilajit supplementation in healthy men aged 35-55. Individual results may vary.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglVNUMX9B2_text","label":"gglVNUMX9B2_text","default":"What Makes Wellness Nest Different"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzlEu8IIrt_text","label":"ggzlEu8IIrt_text","default":"<p>Wellness Nest™ Shilajit Essential Extract is not another supplement. It's not a blend. It's not a proprietary formula hiding behind a fancy label.</p><p><br>It's <strong>100% pure Himalayan shilajit resin</strong>—sourced above 18,000 feet, traditionally extracted, and standardized to contain approximately 70% fulvic acid.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every batch is:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTVPK1p5Cv_text","label":"ggTVPK1p5Cv_text","default":"<p><strong>✓ Third-party tested by Eurofins</strong> for purity, potency, and safety</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>✓ Screened for heavy metals</strong> (tested &lt;0.01 mg/kg)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>✓ Non-GMO, no fillers, no additives</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>✓ Manufactured in an FDA-registered, GMP-certified facility</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmu_c84wr_text","label":"ggOmu_c84wr_text","default":"<p>No BS. No mess. No guessing whether it's real.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggYDwfwOlU_label","label":"gggYDwfwOlU_label","default":"<p>TRY SHILAJIT ESSENTIAL EXTRACT RISK-FREE</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjQaKZJJ9n_text","label":"ggjQaKZJJ9n_text","default":"<p>Just steady, natural energy and focus you can actually feel—backed by testing you can verify.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJDiPczqcc_text","label":"ggJDiPczqcc_text","default":"<p>“Week 2: more ‘go’ at the gym and fewer mid-day lulls. No jitters.” – Aaron P., 44</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0l9-fv5Ky_text","label":"gg0l9-fv5Ky_text","default":"<p>“Clearer head by afternoon. Notice it most on busy days.” – Chris L., 38</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaeM0iVXi3_text","label":"ggaeM0iVXi3_text","default":"What Happens When You Start"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2cz0rR4MV_text","label":"gg2cz0rR4MV_text","default":"<p>Most men notice something within the first week. Not a dramatic transformation—this isn't a stimulant. But something shifts.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMbPsLb3oA_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggMbPsLb3oA_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/1764836642-Untitled_design_93.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmdspxQTE6_text","label":"ggmdspxQTE6_text","default":"<p><strong>Days 3–7:</strong> The afternoon slump doesn't hit as hard. Sleep feels deeper. You wake up without that groggy drag.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEjXU7ilsz_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggEjXU7ilsz_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/1764836642-Untitled_design_93.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBP_k3kPuJ_text","label":"ggBP_k3kPuJ_text","default":"<p><strong>Weeks 2–3: </strong>Focus sharpens. Workouts feel different—more drive, better recovery. Mood steadies.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvQj7fxc5U_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggvQj7fxc5U_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/1764836642-Untitled_design_93.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9AakjMOzE_text","label":"gg9AakjMOzE_text","default":"<p><strong>Weeks 4–6: </strong>Energy feels \"locked in.\" Stamina lasts longer. Evenings aren't wasted. Your partner might comment that you seem... different.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFAnrONBKA_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggFAnrONBKA_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/1764836642-Untitled_design_93.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUN0o4F80t_text","label":"ggUN0o4F80t_text","default":"<p><strong>Month 2 and beyond:</strong> The compound effect kicks in. You're not just managing. You're performing. The version of yourself you remember starts coming back. This isn't magic. It's what happens when you give your body what it's been missing for years.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHz6daiR2t_text","label":"ggHz6daiR2t_text","default":"<p>And for proof—let's check back in on someone who already took that step.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBHCRIYOJH_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBHCRIYOJH_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/1765349737-37a71195-3995-482e-9728-474a1a00c9f0.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggarwKX18E7_text","label":"ggarwKX18E7_text","default":"The Proof Is Hard To Ignore"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxz84nItee_text","label":"ggxz84nItee_text","default":"<p>From surveys and verified reviews, here’s what men most often notice after 4–6 weeks of consistent use:</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggc7DC0v7y-_text","label":"ggc7DC0v7y-_text","default":"<p><strong>✅ 83%</strong> Reported stronger, more consistent energy within 7 days*</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>✅<strong> 71%</strong> Noticed improved mood and focus within 2 weeks*</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>✅ <strong>62%</strong> Experienced higher drive and better gym performance within the first month*</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>✅ <strong>54%</strong> Said their partner noticed the difference before they did*</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkosHdIb3Y_text","label":"ggkosHdIb3Y_text","default":"<p>“By week 3 I stopped reaching for my second coffee. My focus stayed sharp, and my wife noticed I wasn’t crashing at night anymore.” – David R., 41</p>"}],
